# Build context for the LifeOS API image (Dockerfile at the repository root).
# Allowlist: everything is excluded except the backend projects the API build needs
# (LifeOS.Api and the projects it references). The MAUI app, tests, docs, Python services,
# infra, evals, git history and every .env file never enter the context.
*

!src/dotnet/LifeOS.Domain/
!src/dotnet/LifeOS.Application/
!src/dotnet/LifeOS.Infrastructure/
!src/dotnet/LifeOS.Contracts/
!src/dotnet/LifeOS.Api/

# Inside those projects: local build output, IDE and local-only files, and anything secret-shaped.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/Properties/launchSettings.json
**/*.http
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.*.Local.json
**/appsettings.local.json
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/*.bak
**/*.tmp
